      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same thing will happen to delete and update. Upadate wil same as insert just skip the targeted row and add new row which is updated one, \nIn Delete the creation of new file will skip a process that \"append new row \" so the targeted row will be skiped in a new file creation ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Same thing will happen to delete and update. Upadate wil same as insert just skip the targeted row and add new row which is updated one, \nIn Delete the creation of new file will skip a process that \"append new row \" so the targeted row will be skiped in a new file creation ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
