    {
      "id": "A7GWT_e-bfavjBron3HFH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29832.14925466872,
      "y": -8992.333807587836,
      "width": 1864.043701171875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1YV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 514769540,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 289628200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B+ tree is data structure just a B tree which is a sorted tree. Basically it is exdented version of B tree\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B+ tree is data structure just a B tree which is a sorted tree. Basically it is exdented version of B tree\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oCfzaClOQgW0pmoAart04",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29826.349403822336,
      "y": -9425.993030263411,
      "width": 2753.026123046875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1YW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1511478588,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 87366440,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But the problem above are not the only problem without a B+ tree. the real problem is the searching of a particular row\nImagine the a db file with millions of rows means millions of lines a linear search is only option here so t so unoptimised B+ tree solves this by its as follows\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But the problem above are not the only problem without a B+ tree. the real problem is the searching of a particular row\nImagine the a db file with millions of rows means millions of lines a linear search is only option here so t so unoptimised B+ tree solves this by its as follows\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4Xh_FkJW8krhbMVDAqlvF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29842.237001521433,
      "y": -8929.497990434576,
      "width": 1496.69970703125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1YX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2085870852,
      "version": 292,
      "versionNonce": 691500584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Its machenism is good for the database that it is used in almost all dbs sql or nosql\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Its machenism is good for the database that it is used in almost all dbs sql or nosql\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IOc-4EU20sj8P1V_oTWwt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29395.253410322515,
      "y": -7712.89016608179,
      "width": 4483.966796875,
      "height": 88.5312104784616,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1YY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1980632580,
      "version": 280,
      "versionNonce": 1916170536,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is how a B+ tree looks (assuming each leaf node is of 4kb and each row is 40B. So, each node contains 100 rows (roghly ) )",
      "fontSize": 70.82496838276928,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is how a B+ tree looks (assuming each leaf node is of 4kb and each row is 40B. So, each node contains 100 rows (roghly ) )",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
