    {
      "id": "0itUM0zQdaJc0YzBll_XW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29390.712463251777,
      "y": -5377.6455855187405,
      "width": 4515.2412109375,
      "height": 61.271465206528774,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919835068,
      "version": 344,
      "versionNonce": 562512424,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "By this diagram we can see that we saved time and resource which can be wasted on cheking first to node like 300 rows and we just check 301 and than found 302 that mean only 2 rows",
      "fontSize": 49.017172165223016,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "By this diagram we can see that we saved time and resource which can be wasted on cheking first to node like 300 rows and we just check 301 and than found 302 that mean only 2 rows",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SepG93D5lQxofXKhGKVHo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29404.24110724379,
      "y": -5280.794738953871,
      "width": 2529.466796875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1963955844,
      "version": 192,
      "versionNonce": 1722596648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this is happening because of the internals nodes which stores the starting number of the child nodes so by that we can skip the useless nodes\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this is happening because of the internals nodes which stores the starting number of the child nodes so by that we can skip the useless nodes\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oBV2ox1-5Om0ZyV1v56jo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29399.23860633343,
      "y": -5157.097932656347,
      "width": 3486.452880859375,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PuTa78mXf-c_XPi8uzkDr"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 729833276,
      "version": 442,
      "versionNonce": 2137708584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784649902300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Self Note :- we cannot pick a single row from a leaf node cause our hardisks are made this way that have to pick 4kb block and pick that bit which want from that 4kb and discard rest of the block\nFor us OS manages it but we should remember the most granular width we will working on is  4kb ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Self Note :- we cannot pick a single row from a leaf node cause our hardisks are made this way that have to pick 4kb block and pick that bit which want from that 4kb and discard rest of the block\nFor us OS manages it but we should remember the most granular width we will working on is  4kb ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
